            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And those to encamp next to him shall be the tribe of Simeon, the leader of the people of Simeon being Shelumi-el the son of Zurishaddai, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "his host as numbered being fifty-nine thousand three hundred. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the tribe of Gad, the leader of the people of Gad being Eliasaph the son of Reuel, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "his host as numbered being forty-five thousand six hundred and fifty. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The whole number of the camp of Reuben, by their companies, is a hundred and fifty-one thousand four hundred and fifty. They shall set out second.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
