          "text": "The whole number of the camp of Ephraim, by their companies, is a hundred and eight thousand one hundred. They shall set out third on the march.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
